<title>JAPAN: Komatsu Forklift - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu Forklift - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 35.00		vs	   34.64</p>
<p> Operating	  360    million    vs	  180    million</p>
<p> Current	    681    million    vs	  567    million</p>
<p> Net		  341    million    vs	  306    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.87 yen	  vs	    3.47 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     88 million	  vs	  88 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Komatsu Forklift Co Ltd is a major forklift maker affiliated with Komatsu Ltd.</p>
</text>
